--- a/AppKit/NSKeyboardBinding/StandardKeyBindings.keybindings	2026-08-14 13:42:47.197847925 +0200
+++ b/AppKit/NSKeyboardBinding/StandardKeyBindings.keybindings	2026-08-14 13:42:47.197999056 +0200
